cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ravendrel in your research, please cite it."
title: "Ravendrel: A Quantum Programming Language for Quantum Computing, Neural Interfaces and Quantum Robotics"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenMasons"
version: 0.3.3
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/LukaKrajina/Ravendrel"
url: "https://github.com/LukaKrajina/Ravendrel"
abstract: >-
  Ravendrel is an experimental programming language (.rvdl) for quantum
  computing, neural interfaces, quantum language models and quantum robotics.
  The repository provides a VS Code language extension, an LLVM ORC JIT C++
  runtime, a command-line toolchain, a web inference UI, a Go installer, a
  real-time quantum visualizer, and the VedaROS / QbNS subsystems.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum programming language
  - quantum machine learning
  - brain-computer interface
  - quantum robotics
  - LLVM
  - JIT compilation